## 13. The remaining original acquired-observer problem

**Open boundary 13.1 (actual acquisition and executable joint continuation).**
No smallest sufficient acquired joint relation is constructed. For a
finite catalogue or bounded future consumer, sufficient finite acquisition,
certification and update may still be possible; the dimension and packing
conditions are necessary only. The fixed-algebra assumption can also fail
because an observer retains growing/infinite actual archives or maintains
a genuinely implemented source-bound future interaction. Those routes
need their own complete joint laws and resource accounts.

A positive original observer must obtain, authenticate and retain actual
source/epoch identity, reference and calibration, clocks, permissions,
archives, controller inputs and every selector/update input that affects
the declared legal menu. It must supply the original-source map and all
live, rejected and absorbing-failure successors jointly. A family of
source-indexed ideal instruments, a readable programme supplied by fiat,
or a mathematical inverse of whole output laws supplies none of that map.

[Transport–Memory Completion][TM] §§2.9–2.12 and 2.18 still requires
an actual common coherent source/port, aligned acquired readings, known
nonzero amplitudes and known nonzero record overlap. [Process Geometry][PG]
§34 requires the actual joint image (PG.3400b-full), compatible successor
(PG.3400c), and complete running acquisition relation
(PG.3402-run-next). [Atlas Stable Core][ATLAS] Theorem 6.3 requires
each view individually to preserve the stable task distinctions and
executable responses, selectors and updates; joint distinguishability alone
does not establish any individual view's sufficiency. The finite-handoff
obstructions are necessary consumer tests for these interfaces, without
constructing their missing readings or routes.

Full mutual recovery of space, time, boundary and memory, original native
stationary $\alpha/\beta$ memory rate and effective certification/cofinality,
and the independent fixed-Hamiltonian five-mode minimax retain their
unresolved objectives. No source/action/observation/resource correspondence
to PCA, KBONACCI, QJB, NativeLiteralMoore, the C114 mixed-state source,
twisted-ground lattices, TwoClockKrylovClosure or stationary diffusion
compression is supplied. The relaxed phase-only value is not a solution
of those tasks or of the original full-menu implementation problem.

